{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "checkbox",
	"title": "Checkbox 复选框",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "勾选或取消勾选一项，可多选。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"bits-ui@2.20.0",
		"@internationalized/date@^3.12.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"复选框",
				"checkbox",
				"勾选",
				"多选",
				"同意条款"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"从多个选项中选任意个",
				"表单提交前确认一项（如同意条款）"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "立即生效的开关设置",
					"use": "switch"
				},
				{
					"case": "只能选一个",
					"use": "radio-group"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"每个复选框都有可点击的标签",
				"一组复选框用 FieldSet 和 legend 说明"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"标签区域可点击，扩大触控范围"
			],
			"related": [
				"switch",
				"radio-group",
				"field"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Checkbox 设计规范\n\n- Valar 默认复选框参考 Linear 的 Issue labels 列表。方框为 14 × 14 px、圆角 3 px、描边 1 px，未选中底色透明，选中时使用主题蓝紫色及 10 px 浅色勾选图标。\n- 单项复选框使用边界内的焦点提示。方框与勾选标记即时切换。Valar 采用同一强调底色和短横线表达部分选中，禁用与错误沿用表单规则。\n- 每个 Checkbox 都要有可点击的标签：给 Checkbox 设 `id`，用 `Field.Label for={id}`（或 Label）关联，并放在 `<Field.Field orientation=\"horizontal\">` 中（检查规则 `valar/input-label`）。\n- 一组相关的复选框用 `Field.Set` + `Field.Legend` 说明这一组是什么。\n- 用于需要点“保存”“提交”才生效的选项；立即生效的设置用 Switch，多选一用 Radio Group。\n- 状态用 `bind:checked`；部分选中（如“全选”下只选了一部分）用 `indeterminate`，不要换图标模拟。\n- 放在原生表单中提交时设 `name` 和 `value`。错误状态用 `aria-invalid=\"true\"` 加 `Field.Error`（检查规则 `valar/invalid-via-aria`）。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "checkbox/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Checkbox as CheckboxPrimitive } from \"bits-ui\";\n\timport IconPlaceholder from \"$lib/components/icon-placeholder/icon-placeholder.svelte\";\n\timport { cn, type WithoutChildrenOrChild } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tchecked = $bindable(false),\n\t\tindeterminate = $bindable(false),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildrenOrChild<CheckboxPrimitive.RootProps> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<CheckboxPrimitive.Root\n\tbind:ref\n\tdata-slot=\"checkbox\"\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center rounded-[3px] border bg-transparent transition-none [--valar-checkbox-border-base:lch(52.04%_0_282)] [--valar-checkbox-fill-base:lch(53%_52.26_286.91)] [--valar-checkbox-mark-base:lch(100%_5_286.91)] dark:[--valar-checkbox-border-base:lch(48.72%_1.48_272)] dark:[--valar-checkbox-fill-base:lch(47.918%_59.303_288.421)] dark:[--valar-checkbox-mark-base:lch(100%_5_288.421)] border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-border,var(--valar-checkbox-border-base))] data-checked:border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] data-checked:bg-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] data-checked:text-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-mark,var(--valar-checkbox-mark-base))] data-[state=indeterminate]:border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] data-[state=indeterminate]:bg-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] data-[state=indeterminate]:text-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-mark,var(--valar-checkbox-mark-base))] focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-1 aria-invalid:ring-inset aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 aria-invalid:aria-checked:border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 group-has-[:focus-visible]/field-label:ring-0 group-has-[:focus-visible]/field-label:not-data-checked:border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-border,var(--valar-checkbox-border-base))] group-has-[:focus-visible]/field-label:data-checked:border-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-fill,var(--valar-checkbox-fill-base))] data-checked:focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-mark,var(--valar-checkbox-mark-base))] data-[state=indeterminate]:focus-visible:outline-[color:var(--valar-checkbox-mark,var(--valar-checkbox-mark-base))] aria-invalid:focus-visible:outline-destructive peer relative shrink-0 outline-none after:absolute after:-inset-x-3 after:-inset-y-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\tbind:checked\n\tbind:indeterminate\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{#snippet children({ checked, indeterminate })}\n\t\t<div\n\t\t\tdata-slot=\"checkbox-indicator\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"[&>svg]:size-2.5 [&>svg]:scale-y-90 grid place-content-center text-current transition-none\"\n\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t{#if indeterminate}\n\t\t\t\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\t\t\t\tlucide=\"MinusIcon\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttabler=\"IconMinus\"\n\t\t\t\t\thugeicons=\"MinusSignIcon\"\n\t\t\t\t\tphosphor=\"MinusIcon\"\n\t\t\t\t\tremixicon=\"RiSubtractLine\"\n\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t{:else if checked}\n\t\t\t\t<IconPlaceholder\n\t\t\t\t\tlucide=\"CheckIcon\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttabler=\"IconCheck\"\n\t\t\t\t\thugeicons=\"Tick02Icon\"\n\t\t\t\t\tphosphor=\"CheckIcon\"\n\t\t\t\t\tremixicon=\"RiCheckLine\"\n\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t{/if}\n\t\t</div>\n\t{/snippet}\n</CheckboxPrimitive.Root>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "checkbox/checkbox.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./checkbox.svelte\";\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Checkbox,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "checkbox/index.ts"
		}
	]
}